    <img class="about-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511818966892-d7d671e672a2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Architectural form and light — replace with a personal portrait or project image"/>
    <div class="about-copy"><h2>Architecture as a way of understanding the world.</h2><p>I am an architecture designer and researcher interested in how people experience, interpret and shape the built environment. My work moves between spatial design, visual documentation and academic inquiry.</p><p>This portfolio is an evolving record of selected projects, observations and research. It brings together different ways of looking at space, place and everyday life.</p>
